    COMP -->|"✅ imports"| DOM

    APP -->|"✅ imports"| DOM

    INFRA -->|"✅ imports"| DOM

    %% Forbidden imports (red dashed arrows)
    DOM -.-x|"❌ FORBIDDEN"| APP
    DOM -.-x|"❌ FORBIDDEN"| INFRA
    DOM -.-x|"❌ FORBIDDEN"| COMP
    DOM -.-x|"❌ FORBIDDEN"| INT

    APP -.-x|"❌ FORBIDDEN"| INFRA
